{
  "$schema": "../case-file.schema.json",
  "description": "The opt-in cmp module (a consent provider) reading every supported CMP's cookie with its default category. A refusal in a CMP's cookie denies storage and deletes the ID cookies with or without GDPR, and over a TC string that allows storage; a grant allows storage where GDPR applies (gdpr=1) and there's no TC string, and never over GPC, COPPA, the opt-out cookie or a TC string that denies it; a cookie written before the visitor chose, or one the module can't read, changes nothing. TC strings: CAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA.eAAAAAAAAA has publisher consent for purposes 1-2; CAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA.aAAAAAAAAA for purpose 2 only.",
  "build": [
    "vendor-modules"
  ],
  "config": {
    "SID_MODULES": "cmp",
    "SID_MODULE_CONFIG": "{\"cmp\":{\"cookieyes\":{},\"onetrust\":{},\"cookiebot\":{},\"complianz\":{},\"iubenda\":{},\"borlabs\":{}}}"
  },
  "cases": [
